Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.80,0:00:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have your injuries improved\Nany, Avdol? They have.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.98,0:00:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As relieved as I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.76,0:00:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm even more relieved\Nknowing you're alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.36,0:00:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, well, I'm fortunate there was\Nno significant damage to my cornea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm expected to make a full recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This takes me back to middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,During what should have\Nbeen an ordinary game,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.74,0:00:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one of my classmates took\Na baseball to the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.44,0:00:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was good as new the next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as it turned out, his eye\Nhad only lost a bit of fluid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.76,0:00:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.59,0:00:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get these bandages off in no time,\Nand I'll catch up with you in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.08,0:00:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In 800 kilometers are Cairo and Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.10,0:00:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, you must remain vigilant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.44,0:00:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.66,0:00:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of language is this\Nhospital bill written in anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.14,0:00:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it's supposed to be Arabic,\Nbut man, if this crap isn't confusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.56,0:00:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The zero is a five, the decimal\Nis a zero, and the seven is a six.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.42,0:01:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what the heck is this wormy-looking\Nthingamajig supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.32,0:01:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a four, so the amount we owe is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.66,0:01:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,46,350 Egyptian pounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.58,0:01:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.40,0:01:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.38,0:01:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of dog is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.00,0:01:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so funny looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.91,0:01:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.83,0:01:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why in the world is he chewing gum?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.36,0:01:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must be waiting for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.46,0:01:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a good little doggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.36,0:01:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here I thought Iggy\Nwas waiting for us outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.02,0:01:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.93,0:01:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's a hit with the ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.62,0:01:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we tell him doggies\Ndon't usually chew gum?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.14,0:01:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a peculiar little puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.24,0:01:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.34,0:01:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.25,0:01:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's a little bit of\Nfriendly advice for you girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.56,0:01:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step away if you know what's good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.50,0:01:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know he comes across as a\Ncharming furball at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.58,0:01:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but deep in his soul, he harbors\Nan extreme hatred for people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.84,0:01:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're not careful\Nwhen you least expect...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.98,0:01:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.62,0:01:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off of me, you damn mutt!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.50,0:01:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a beauty!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.34,0:01:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you get along so well!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.94,0:01:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In your dreams, we don't get along at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.48,0:01:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Iggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.40,0:01:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you get the hell off of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.84,0:02:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll catch you guys later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you, lovebirds. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.92,0:02:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, please help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.40,0:02:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hang on a minute, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.94,0:02:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You nasty little mutt!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.49,0:02:17.33,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,952.999)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.12,0:02:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.24,0:03:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end of the world
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.92,0:03:48.46,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,640)\pos(151,850.001)}Episode 28: Anubis, Part 1 {Working file name: SC_28_Watch_As_I_Pull_This_Sword_Out_Of_My.ass}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.52,0:03:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In ancient times,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.92,0:03:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Egyptians were in the\Nhabit of burying their dead
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on the west bank of the\NNile where the sun sets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.96,0:03:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the reason Egyptian cities\Nstand on the east side of the Nile.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.94,0:03:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the west side, however,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.50,0:03:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're likely to find graves and\Nmortuary temples scattered about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But our enemies don't\Ncare about east or west.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll come from whatever\Ndirection is most advantageous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.30,0:04:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I know you didn't ask for my opinion,\Nbut your cows are far too lethargic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although they're strong,\NI'll give them that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.58,0:04:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move your ass, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.92,0:04:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And would you stop\Ndragging the rear already?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.46,0:04:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a disgrace!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.92,0:04:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some man you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.18,0:04:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you, my son?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.24,0:04:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like your son and your\Ncow have something in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.42,0:04:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.38,0:04:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's something like this\Ndoing out here? Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.76,0:04:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.78,0:04:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.69,0:04:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.64,0:04:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must have been dropped!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.68,0:04:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe no one's\Ncome back to claim it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.76,0:04:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their loss is our gain, because this\Nsword is probably worth a fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.70,0:04:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what if the owner's\Nstill in the area?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor guy must be\Npanicking right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.88,0:05:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the off chance it's some\Nkind of fancy-schmancy artifact,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shouldn't we give it to the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.20,0:05:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.18,0:05:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sword could be the end\Nof all of our money troubles!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.42,0:05:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm the one who found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.46,0:05:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be worth a damn\Nthing if it's blunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.76,0:05:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull it out so we can take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.32,0:05:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.98,0:05:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.12,0:05:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The damn thing won't budge!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell won't it come out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.96,0:05:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.16,0:05:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me try it. Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.40,0:05:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hold this end. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.46,0:05:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blade hasn't moved\Na single centimeter!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.14,0:05:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, let me have a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.10,0:05:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.26,0:05:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can't free it, what chance\Ndoes an idiot like you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.88,0:05:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.00,0:05:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.90,0:05:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.06,0:05:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it spewing blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.30,0:06:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell did the sword cut me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.36,0:06:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We pulled on a damn thing, but\Nthe blade wouldn't come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.06,0:06:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I did was grab it by the hill!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.02,0:06:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something\Nstrange about that sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.12,0:06:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, you think now's\Na good time for me to try?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.86,0:06:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what? Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.30,0:06:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and try it if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.10,0:06:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It came out so easy, I didn't put\Nthe slightest bit of effort into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.58,0:06:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.49,0:06:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.84,0:06:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.62,0:06:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hear the blade ringing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.00,0:06:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm by no means an expert when it comes\Nto swords or things of that nature,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.84,0:06:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I don't think I've ever\Nencountered a blade this beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.84,0:06:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a rare Japanese katana.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.72,0:06:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It glistens like it's\Ncloaked in ice-cold water.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.30,0:06:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been graced with\Nan amazing discovery!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hand it over, my boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.32,0:07:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like you, has no business\Nwielding such a valuable treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.98,0:07:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh god! Seiko! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.42,0:07:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you do this thing out? Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.36,0:07:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.82,0:07:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were standing behind me,\Nand before I knew it, the sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.42,0:07:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.30,0:07:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you just standing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:22.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to hurry and get him to\Na doctor before it's too late!
