Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.50,0:07:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sword is evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.98,0:07:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost as though the\Nblade has a mind of its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.26,0:07:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.68,0:07:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still your heart, Chaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.80,0:07:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their deaths mean nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.76,0:07:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing whatsoever, Chaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.02,0:07:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.93,0:07:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.44,0:07:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see you, but\NI can hear your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.20,0:07:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the stand of the god\NAnubis, ruler of the underworld,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.26,0:08:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,deity of embalming, and lord of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.76,0:08:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have unsheathed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thus you shall be my standard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.36,0:08:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are a virtuoso.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.22,0:08:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I shall make you master the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.72,0:08:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one of the soul is stronger than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.76,0:08:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shall wield me and you shall kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.98,0:08:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father and that man deserve to die, so\Nthey should be thrilled that I killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.52,0:08:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll hack you to\Npieces while I'm on a roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why you Minichaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.56,0:08:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't really want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.94,0:08:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please let me live, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.98,0:08:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't want to die!
