Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.66,0:08:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell did he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.06,0:08:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow the cow's completely unharmed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.80,0:08:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slaughter Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.90,0:08:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slice Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.84,0:08:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cleave Jotaro in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.00,0:09:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you are a fighting\Ngenius, a master of the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.84,0:09:05.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one in the world is\Na match for your blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.74,0:09:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.10,0:09:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Bo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.54,0:09:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, do we really have time\Nto lounge around in this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.10,0:09:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you quit complaining?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.84,0:09:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've been kind enough to\Nallow us passage on their ferry,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.60,0:09:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we must show our respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.80,0:09:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know about you guys, but I'm\Nstarving, so let's get something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.78,0:09:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you never stop, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.00,0:09:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, this should tide you over for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.12,0:09:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know damn well that's Iggy's!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.16,0:09:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you just take the gum already?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.22,0:09:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's the bathroom, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.32,0:09:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we look for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.72,0:09:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, mister, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.84,0:09:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanna buy some papyrus?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.72,0:09:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This papyrus is the original paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want a piece of Egyptian history?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.68,0:09:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.64,0:09:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is 100 % Bone Feet\Npapyrus. Papyrus, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.18,0:09:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a good price.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.94,0:09:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you positive this is the real thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.14,0:09:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.24,0:10:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll have you know a famous Egyptian\Ncraftsman drew this, so it's quite genuine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.40,0:10:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.64,0:10:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This crap is fake and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.76,0:10:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this were actual papyrus,\Nit wouldn't rip so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.60,0:10:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm no fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.72,0:10:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should try a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.80,0:10:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the love of, where'd Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.62,0:10:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar and the others go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that Iggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.06,0:10:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, you get back here, you little butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.32,0:10:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what about my body?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.18,0:10:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.58,0:10:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He managed to get away.
