Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.46,0:11:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Chaka,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.10,0:11:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and my stand is known as Anubis, the\None true ruler of the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, Jean-Pierre Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.82,0:11:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare to surrender your life to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.50,0:12:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to surrender my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.56,0:12:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, oh man, you sure don't\Nmince words, do you, Chaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.88,0:12:09.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If nothing else, your confidence is more\Nimpressive than your other companions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.08,0:12:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see if your Anubis stand\Nis all it's cracked up to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.08,0:12:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come out, chariot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.40,0:12:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's brandishing his sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.44,0:12:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but is he really planning to fight\Nme with that instead of his stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.66,0:12:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.78,0:13:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His movements, his grip, his stance,\Nthey're the dead giveaways of an amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.06,0:13:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.12,0:13:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to keep my distance from him.
