Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.56,0:13:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.80,0:13:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His sword passed right through the pillar!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.16,0:13:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if that wasn't enough, he got me without\Nleaving even a single tear in my shirt!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.20,0:13:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't stepped back when\NI did, I would've been killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.30,0:13:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard! Chariot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.00,0:13:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.18,0:13:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you show yourself and face\Nme like a real fighter, you coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.74,0:14:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Merd.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.90,0:14:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.90,0:14:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.24,0:14:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could be hiding behind\Nany one of these pillars.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.28,0:14:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judging from his attacks, his sword\Ncan pass through solid objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.44,0:14:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And unfortunately for me, my chariot's\Nstriking range is only about one meter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.96,0:14:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.87,0:14:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's tougher than I thought he'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.60,0:14:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I honestly can't believe\Nthis asshole is actually
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.18,0:14:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,giving me a run for my\Nmoney in a sword fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.90,0:14:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But mark my words, you won't\Nhave the upper hand for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.24,0:14:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Chaka, are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.88,0:14:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a nice view, so\Nlet's see what you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.08,0:14:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can sneak up\Non me if I'm not behind a pillar!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.28,0:14:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you're planning on\Npopping out of the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.90,0:15:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.84,0:15:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's behind the pillar?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.36,0:15:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sword doesn't need\Nto pass through objects!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.50,0:15:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the power of this blade, I\Ncan cut through the pillar itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.74,0:15:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now die, Ponder F!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.20,0:15:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.80,0:15:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That technique is so secret that\Nnot even Jotaro knows about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.84,0:15:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silver Chariot can launch its rapier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The downside is I only get one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.76,0:15:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My opponent dodges I'm history.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.08,0:15:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A last resort once I've\Nexhausted my other options.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.18,0:15:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While it's true I didn't kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.44,0:16:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I highly doubt you'll be getting\Nback up for another round.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.26,0:16:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.52,0:16:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.48,0:16:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the heck did it get\Nback into its scabbard?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.74,0:16:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did it slip in by chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.78,0:16:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't notice before,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.86,0:16:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now that I see it up close, I\Nfully appreciate the sword's beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.78,0:16:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to unsheathe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.18,0:16:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.68,0:16:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thought we'd lost you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.78,0:16:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were worried when you up\Nand vanished by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.46,0:16:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We thought you'd been\Nambushed by the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.22,0:16:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.22,0:17:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.13,0:17:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, Mr. Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.94,0:17:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so fuzzy I can't think straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.04,0:17:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's from being tossed around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.20,0:17:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My injuries are worse than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.44,0:17:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, why are you\Nsquatting like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.74,0:17:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't step and poop, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.64,0:17:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.96,0:17:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, how did you\Ncome across that sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.46,0:17:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did something happen out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.04,0:17:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.95,0:17:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a showdown with some\Ndirtbag that attacked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.92,0:17:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An enemy stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.75,0:17:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.02,0:17:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said his stand was\Nknown as the God Anubis.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.72,0:17:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was able to literally\Nphase through objects and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.78,0:17:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cut them once it had a\Ntarget in its crosshairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.62,0:17:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was a strong foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.52,0:17:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But despite his formidable power,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.68,0:17:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when all was said and done,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.18,0:17:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he was no match for the likes of\Nme, Polnareff reassured himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.98,0:17:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was using this sword as his weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.28,0:17:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.28,0:17:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd those rats come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.78,0:17:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why are they making off of the sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.60,0:17:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.88,0:18:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, talk about creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.16,0:18:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one told me even the rats\Nsteal stuff in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.52,0:18:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you guys want to steal\Nsomething, steal some cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.02,0:18:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.70,0:18:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sword's stuck in the scabbard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.62,0:18:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's jammed in here really tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.66,0:18:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.22,0:18:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While I'm relieved that you're all right,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.26,0:18:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't ever run off by\Nyourself again, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.76,0:18:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.82,0:18:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy will find a way to attack you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.74,0:18:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if you're just\Nalone for a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.50,0:18:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.24,0:18:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the sound of our\Nship taking off without us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.62,0:18:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry and get on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.28,0:18:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're heading to Edfa today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.74,0:18:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Come on, guys. Wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.96,0:18:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, so you decided to bring\Nthe sword with you after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.06,0:18:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm going to turn\Nit in to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.38,0:18:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing is a dangerous\Nweapon, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.30,0:19:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, that's a good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.36,0:19:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone could pick it up at those\Nruins, so we can't take any chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.86,0:19:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's probably worth a small fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.94,0:19:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet, Iggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.92,0:19:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't make noise in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you keep this up,\Nwe can get kicked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.14,0:19:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong\Nwith that mutt today?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.76,0:19:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, well, since the\Ndamn dog won't shut up,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.16,0:19:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll just take\Nthe sword to the cops now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.18,0:19:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, weren't you listening when\Nwe told you not to go off on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.98,0:19:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, we talked about this earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.62,0:19:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, tag along and keep\Nhim out of trouble, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.58,0:19:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.18,0:19:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, shouldn't our first stop\Nhave been the police station?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.92,0:19:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, take it easy, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.30,0:19:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A man's got to look his absolute\Nbest, as the saying goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.90,0:19:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, before I forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.26,0:20:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man, you mind putting this\Nover there out of the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.18,0:20:03.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.09,0:20:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing's a dangerous weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.46,0:20:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, back to what\NI was saying earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.84,0:20:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did a fair amount of rolling around\Nand ended up getting kind of dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.48,0:20:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make this face gorgeous\Nagain, Mr. Barber. Will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.26,0:20:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.70,0:20:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, would you watch it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.24,0:20:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case you haven't\Nnoticed, that razor's dull.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.50,0:20:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.66,0:20:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Barber, sharpen that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.16,0:20:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is supposed to be the most\Nrelaxing part of the haircut.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.20,0:20:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.62,0:20:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a prima donna.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.08,0:20:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.66,0:20:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.66,0:21:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, better. Much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.04,0:21:18.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's a shave, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.50,0:21:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Barber.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.41,0:21:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.62,0:21:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.50,0:21:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.32,0:21:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tre Bone, barber.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.30,0:21:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tre Bone, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.90,0:21:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, if you wouldn't mind\Ngetting under my chin. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.58,0:21:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.34,0:21:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Under your chin, yes. Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.52,0:21:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.10,0:21:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did say under your\Nchin, right, Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.24,0:21:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.80,0:21:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember me, you fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.54,0:21:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the Anubistan, and this\Ntime you're going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.04,0:22:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.80,0:23:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sword is the stand\Ni won't lose twice to
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.43,0:23:28.43,Next Episode,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,730)}Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.30,0:23:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the same adversary this\Nguy's strong the more
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.02,0:23:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we fight this stand the faster it gets his
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.76,0:23:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eyes that stare this\Ntime i'll take your head
